{"sourceUrl":"https://www.hospital-cqmu.com/gzb_yxjy_yjsjyn_zsgl/010082100038443.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:13.930596+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.fahcqmu.cn/gzb_yxjy_yjsjyn_zsgl/010082100038443.html","html":"<div><p><strong><span><span>亲爱的</span><span>2026届同学们： </span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>为助力医学生深入了解未来学习与职业发展路径</span><span>，近距离感知临床与科研前沿，重庆医科大学第一临床学院</span><span>将开展</span><span>首届</span><span>大学生</span><span>校园开放日活动</span><span>。现诚挚邀请全国高校医学相关专业本科生共赴山城</span><span>，零距离感受我院育人环境与学科魅力</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>一、</span><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>1.</span></strong><strong><span>时间</span></strong><span><span>：</span><span>2025年7月16日9:00 - 7月18日24:00 </span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>2.流程</span></strong><span><span>：</span>  </span></p>\n<p><span>填写问卷星报名</span><span>https://www.wjx.cn/vm/QjZQAwR.aspx</span><span>，同时将个人简历发送至邮箱</span><span>1217050649@qq.com</span><span> </span><span>，以上两类材料均提交，报名方成功。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>二、活动时间</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>2025年7月</span><span>25</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>三、活动地点</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>重庆医科大学附属第一医院</span><span>（重庆市渝中区友谊路</span><span>1号</span><span>）</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>四、活动对象</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>全日制普通高校</span><span>2026届本科毕业生，专业背景符合我校相应类型研究生报考条件。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>五、</span><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">\n<p><span><strong><span><span>初遇</span><span>“崇医”行</span></span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><strong><span>时间</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><strong><span>地点</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>8:15-8：45</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>学生报到、领取活动物资</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>医院会议室</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>9:00-10:30</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>开幕式、直播、招生宣讲</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>医院会议室</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">\n<p><span><strong><span><span>从</span><span>“仁爱”启航</span></span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><strong><span>时间</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><strong><span>地点</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>10:40-11:40</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>优势科室深度参访</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>科室</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>12:00-13:00</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span>午餐会</span><span>+在读研究生经验分享</span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>医院食堂</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">\n<p><span><strong><span><span>在</span><span>“精业”中感受毫厘之差</span></span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><strong><span>时间</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><strong><span>地点</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>13:15-15:00</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>参观实验室，感受那个时代的医学之路</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>实验室</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">\n<p><span><strong><span>从继承到创新之路</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><strong><span>时间</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><strong><span>地点</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>15:15-16:00</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>校史馆文化研学</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>校史馆</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>16:00-17:00</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>图书馆学术资源体验</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>学校图书馆</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>17:00-17:30</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>闭幕式</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>学校</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong><span> </span></strong></p>\n<p><span>六、</span><strong><span>活动形式</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>   <span>本次活动采取游戏获新知的打卡形式，</span></span></strong><span><span>共设置八个站点，从</span><span>“初遇·杏林新芽”启程，至“光影·医路留光”收官。学生需在每一站深度参与对应活动，完成互动任务并获得该站勋章后，方可解锁进入下一站。成功完成全部站点活动者，将获得我院颁发的结业证书一份。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>七、其他</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. 活动当天（7月25日），请携带身份证、学生证原件及复印件现场报到。</span></p>\n<p><span>2. 活动期间免费提供午餐、活动物资、防暑用品及人身意外伤害保险，其余住宿、餐饮费用需自理。</span></p>\n<p><span>3. 学生往返交通费原则上自理，若有特殊情况请及时联系我院研究生管理处。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：文老师、唐老师</span>    <span>联系电话：</span><span>023-89012704</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>温馨提醒：</span></strong><span>重庆天气炎热请往返途中注意防暑。</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>重庆医科大学第一临床学院</span></p>\n<p><span>2025年7月14日</span></p></div>","textSha256":"8125c77121d07a15a8ebdc359fd5623381380202b1139d178d6e1b9ec7c65821","textLength":915,"sourceSha256":"a153f1bc379469312c70befb9d3a07af97c0dfb5d7c701bfc911d6717f0306a2","selector":"article-like:news-content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9016d9e41a30d00fec8e","title":"2025年重庆医科大学第一临床学院 2025年首届全国大学生校园开放日活动","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:13.930596+00:00"}
